In the first round of the game, the Sender decides to give $4 to the Receiver. The Receiver thus gets $4 and the Sender gets $6. The Observer then writes a message for the Sender. The Observer says to the Sender: "That was really nice of you. If I was the Receiver, I'd be pretty happy."
